  "methodology": "One fresh OS-crypto session per workload; exactly100000 measured actualORAM accesses each, materialization+1000warmup excluded. Discrete KS uniform null calibrated by5000multinomial draws; two-workload KS and MI by499permutations. Holm correction across11 predefined diagnosticpvalues. MI is biased plugin estimate with reported permutationnull baseline. Numeric leaf autocorrelations at stated lags are exploratory features.",
  "limitations": "One trial per workload cannot establish cross-session robustness, statistical independence or indistinguishability. Permutation/multinomial references model exchangeable IID nulls; failure to reject does not prove them. Correlation depends on arbitrary numeric leaf labels. Same-address logical dependence is unidentifiable because the logical variable is constant. No timing classifier, cache, network, composition or active-attack claim. Workloadseed reproducible; cryptographic leaves/keys/nonces intentionally OS-random."
